  "name": "Astral Cloak",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/VeiledMoon_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You are invisible as long as you remain in moonlight.</p><p>If you leave the shadow, this effect immediately ends.</p><p>This effect also ends immediately if you attack a creature, cast a spell, or use a hostile ability.</p><p>You can spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> at the start of your turn to sustain this effect. If you do so, you may change between the <strong>Astral</strong> or <strong>Umbral</strong> effects.</p>",
